    <p class="credit">
      /feral &middot; runs entirely in this browser &middot; no network calls &middot; one local record kept on this device
    </p>

    <!-- briefing / docket overlay -->
    <div class="veil" id="veil">
      <div class="briefing" id="briefing">
        <h1>PROCESS UNIT 4</h1>
        <ul>
          <li>RAISE FEED RATE TO PRODUCE UNITS.</li>
          <li>FEED RAISES PRESSURE AND TEMPERATURE.</li>
          <li>VENT LOWERS PRESSURE. OUTPUT STOPS WHILE OPEN.</li>
          <li>PRESSURE ABOVE 55 RAISES TEMPERATURE.</li>
